  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Leaves 为树叶方块添加了额外的层次，使它们看起来更茂密、更浓密、更自然。</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_9d06bbdd-8ddf-4736-9d77-6167f48dac56.webp\" alt=\"展示一个树叶方块和文字 'Better Leaves' 的横幅图片\" width=\"739\" height=\"118\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">9.0 版本专注于性能提升，为每种树叶自动生成纹理。与 8.1 版本不同，此版本是非动态的，因此您需要按照几个简单步骤来编译自定义版本，以便与纹理包配合使用。</span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RL_--nShJ9w\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 8.1 及更低版本中，此资源包不添加任何纹理，因此可直接与几乎所有资源包和模组兼容（纹理会自动动态调整）。不过，这会牺牲一些性能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>我强烈建议您安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcull-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Leaves</a> 模组，并配合 Sodium/Embeddium 使用，以获得更高的 FPS。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>喜欢这个包？请查看我的另一个包——</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/round-trees-mc-vanilla-1-8-1-13\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Round Trees</strong></a><strong>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/round-trees-mc-vanilla-1-8-1-13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_dd79c2f8-007f-491a-98b2-ced3f8c5b4bf.webp\" alt=\"带有 'Round Trees' 标题的圆木图片\" width=\"496\" height=\"91\"></span></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/893/699/betterleavesbop.jpg\" width=\"842\" height=\"219\"></p><p>明确支持的模组（v9.5）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faurorasdecorations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblockus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblossom\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blossom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%25